    {
        "id": "4adbd09f5bccf316",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "5ba26a24c710b79c",
        "name": "Basic",
        "info": "**To simplify, a 3D object always consists of:**\nGeometry    = Shape\nMaterial    = Color/Appearance\nMesh        = Geometry + Material\nScene       = Place to place the Mesh\n\n**Sistem koordinat Three.js**\n0,0,0 in center\n          Y+\n          ↑\n          |\n          |\n          |\n          O----------→ X+\n         /\n        /\n       /\n     Z+\n           Y+\n            ↑\n            |\n            |\n            |\nX- <--------O--------> X+\n            |\n            |\n            |\n            ↓\n           Y-",
        "x": 110,
        "y": 40,
        "wires": []
    },
